<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Remplacer gaz par PAC à villejuif 94 : aides 10 800€, reste charge 2500€. Devis RGE gratuit 24h.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.maprimeadapt-idf.fr/remplacer-gaz-pac-villejuif-94">
<title>Remplacer gaz par PAC à villejuif 94 : aides 10 800€ cumulées</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8eef7 100%); color: #2c3e50; }
.container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
.hero { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 50px 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 40px; }
.hero h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a3d2b; }
.section { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 30px; }
.section h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a3d2b; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.form { background: #1a3d2b; color: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
.form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
.form-group input { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; }
.btn-submit { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: white; color: #1a3d2b; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "LocalBusiness", "name": "Mon Projet Habitat - villejuif", "telephone": "06 04 43 34 20", "areaServed": {"@type": "City", "name": "villejuif"}}
</script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Remplacer gaz par PAC à villejuif 94 : aides 10 800€ cumulées</h1>
    <p><strong>villejuif (94) :</strong> PAC air-eau 12-14k€ → aides 10 800€ déduites → reste 2500€. Aides MaPrimeRénov' 5k€ + CEE 9k€. Devis RGE gratuit 24h.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="section">
    <h2>villejuif 94 : aides et économies</h2>
    <p><strong>Aides cumulées :</strong> MaPrimeRénov' 5000€ + CEE 9000€ + TVA 5.5% + bonus régional = 10 800€. <strong>Reste à charge :</strong> 2500€ (ou 45€/mois Éco-PTZ 0%). Économies +1000€/an vs chauffage actuel.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="form">
    <h2>Devis PAC gratuit</h2>
    <form onsubmit="submitForm(event)">
      <div class="form-group"><label>Nom *</label><input type="text" name="nom" required></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label>Téléphone *</label><input type="tel" name="tel" placeholder="06 XX XX XX XX" required></div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Recevoir devis villejuif</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
function submitForm(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  fetch('/api/lead', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ nom: e.target.nom.value, tel: e.target.tel.value, source: 'remplacer-gaz-pac-villejuif-94', commune: 'villejuif', chauffage_actuel: 'gaz' }) }).then(r => r.json()).then(r => { if(r.ok) alert('Devis en 24-48h'); });
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
